  "description": "The proposed works comprise the reconfiguration and refurbishment of Sebright Primary School.\n\nThe extent of the reconfiguration works relates to the western portion of the ground floor and ground floor mezzanine. The proposals comprise the demolition of existing partition walls and installation of new partitions to new areas, as per the existing and proposed floor plans appended to this application. The proposals also include the creation of a door aperture to the rear WC block extension to facilitate a new fire exit route to meet fire safety requirements. \n\nAncillary to the layout reconfiguration are subsequent refurbishment works to adapt and upgrade existing M&E services to suit the new layout, as well as new pipework, cabling, lighting and radiators. Also proposed are minor masonry and joinery repairs to the work area.",
